# Third-party notices

## Adapted from dotpm / obsidian-pm

Portions of the navigation and UI architecture in Projects Engine are adapted from:

- Repository: [dotpm/obsidian-pm](https://github.com/dotpm/obsidian-pm)
- Product name: **dotpm** (plugin id `project-manager`)
- License: MIT
- Copyright: © 2026 Stepan Kropachev and dotpm contributors

Adapted patterns include (non-exhaustive): ViewRouter / in-leaf navigation, Dashboard → Overview → Workspace funnel, ViewSwitcher segmented control, EmptyState fluent panel, toolbar / project-header chrome scaffold, and SubView hosting of Table / Gantt / Board modes.

Projects Engine keeps its own plugin id (`projects-engine`), display name, branding, frontmatter namespace (`pe_type` / PE domain keys), and domain features (governance models, stakeholders, custom catalogue fields, Teams URL, PRINCE2 registers, etc.). Local API / MCP / CLI packages, funding URLs, and dotpm branding were **not** copied.

